{
    "word": "wetness",
    "lang_code": "en",
    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "fb704ba9-bfc8-36f2-a4af-bb06dca5f449",
                "word": "wetness",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "6e367204-52d4-481b-bb70-112c648865d5",
                        "entry_id": "fb704ba9-bfc8-36f2-a4af-bb06dca5f449",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "wetnesses"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "cfc06c22-37af-3085-bf18-1a999a7b49a8",
                        "entry_id": "fb704ba9-bfc8-36f2-a4af-bb06dca5f449",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The condition of being wet."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "uncountable",
                            "usually"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c749ae67-863a-4ef2-93c2-bf249b00be22",
                                "sense_id": "cfc06c22-37af-3085-bf18-1a999a7b49a8",
                                "text": "The young man looked long and fixedly on the place, the sight of which interested him so much that he had forgotten, in the eagerness of youthful curiosity, the wetness of his dress."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "50f2ca2f-35bd-4875-b94b-1d0abf991e34",
                                "sense_id": "cfc06c22-37af-3085-bf18-1a999a7b49a8",
                                "text": "The first business was to make a fire, an operation which was a little delayed by the wetness of the fuel and the ground, owing to the heavy showers of the afternoon."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c213ad8b-8a09-4c44-896d-dcb5aecde5ab",
                                "sense_id": "cfc06c22-37af-3085-bf18-1a999a7b49a8",
                                "text": "The industrial brewers continue to prosper, but now they are facing a new challenge from local brewers across the country who are dedicated to turning out brews that have only one thing in common with industrial beer—wetness."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "bb69c57c-ab33-3089-9bd7-c24f4f10b6b5",
                        "entry_id": "fb704ba9-bfc8-36f2-a4af-bb06dca5f449",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Moisture."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "uncountable",
                            "usually"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "3b1954c6-4e19-4de1-ba56-e08308c3f2c8",
                                "sense_id": "bb69c57c-ab33-3089-9bd7-c24f4f10b6b5",
                                "text": "“Oh! if I had my gravity,” thought she, contemplating the water, “I would flash off this balcony like a long white sea-bird, headlong into the darling wetness. Heigh-ho!”"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d87c06b4-61b1-484e-858b-3e100ea08912",
                                "sense_id": "bb69c57c-ab33-3089-9bd7-c24f4f10b6b5",
                                "text": "And so nature was not interfered with in the middle of the rainy season. Sometimes it poured down in such thick sheets of water that earth and sky seemed merged in one grey wetness."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "1601032e-c0e1-328a-a952-a2cdd24de988",
                        "entry_id": "fb704ba9-bfc8-36f2-a4af-bb06dca5f449",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Rainy or damp weather."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "uncountable",
                            "usually"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "2a8bd2b3-afb1-4f10-bed1-445d65d95d61",
                                "sense_id": "1601032e-c0e1-328a-a952-a2cdd24de988",
                                "text": "1797, Tobias Smollett et al., The History of England, from the Revolution to the End of the American War and the Peace of Versailles in 1783, Philadelphia: Robert Campbell, Volume 4, Book 5, p. 484,\nThey complained, that the wetness of the season, and the scarcity of fodder in the year 1762, with other natural causes, had reduced the quantity of fat cattle, by discouraging the farmers from rearing them."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "badf37e3-6f79-4fde-9997-468f3e32b303",
                                "sense_id": "1601032e-c0e1-328a-a952-a2cdd24de988",
                                "text": "Tanoo, Skedans and Cumshewa lie fairly close to each other on the map, yet each is quite unlike the others when you come to it. All have the West Coast wetness but Cumshewa seems always to drip, always to be blurred with mist, its foliage always to hang wet-heavy."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "bdfd74e6-eff2-4c0b-9800-4f882c410929",
                        "source_entry_id": "fb704ba9-bfc8-36f2-a4af-bb06dca5f449",
                        "source_sense_description": "condition of being wet",
                        "target_lang_word": "humidité",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "humidité",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1580ebae-cb10-3de1-97e9-61f70a6e19f4",
                                        "entry_id": "8a85884c-c5b9-36ae-b9a5-d5ac55e4aae0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qualité de ce qui est humide."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "87456707-e8db-466f-a089-3d2d67847c3b",
                                                "sense_id": "1580ebae-cb10-3de1-97e9-61f70a6e19f4",
                                                "text": "Le soir était venu. Nicole frotta plusieurs allumettes sur le plancher ; mais l’humidité s'opposait à leur inflammation, […]."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9fecd195-26e6-490b-96a5-1588f51fd213",
                                                "sense_id": "1580ebae-cb10-3de1-97e9-61f70a6e19f4",
                                                "text": "Christophe Michalak — encore un pâtissier canon ! — conseille de saupoudrer le tiramisu de sucre glace avant de le recouvrir de cacao ; la couche de sucre va absorber l’humidité de la crème, laissant le cacao impec…"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bae4b2d1-d3f1-4398-b4de-d9d38850c3bf",
                                                "sense_id": "1580ebae-cb10-3de1-97e9-61f70a6e19f4",
                                                "text": "Je me livrais souvent à la pêche. L’humidité avait enlevé beaucoup d’élasticité à mon arc et je préférais harponner les dorades lorsqu’elles passaient à ma portée."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5f165113-330f-4935-a234-a3d5ded38e20",
                                                "sense_id": "1580ebae-cb10-3de1-97e9-61f70a6e19f4",
                                                "text": "La mesure de la teneur en humidité d’un sol et la force de rétention de l’eau par celui-ci revêtent une grande importance pour l’aménagement des bassins versants et l’hydrologie."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8a0690f1-f150-3a3b-b15a-a782ac3c2d4f",
                                        "entry_id": "8a85884c-c5b9-36ae-b9a5-d5ac55e4aae0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Eau atmosphérique."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Absolument"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "92e6cd02-5b38-431e-a087-649ed9b70eee",
                                                "sense_id": "8a0690f1-f150-3a3b-b15a-a782ac3c2d4f",
                                                "text": "[…] ; je descendis à la lueur des flambeaux dans cette habitation de gnomes, enfoncée sous terre d'environ quatre vingt pieds ; mais l’humidité, la fraicheur et la fumée des torches abrégèrent ma promenade."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "88b43c56-e1fa-4698-b974-d373dcabdd94",
                                                "sense_id": "8a0690f1-f150-3a3b-b15a-a782ac3c2d4f",
                                                "text": "Le ciel était nuageux, l’humidité pénétrante. Entre des éclaircies de soleil, des averses tombaient."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "55864ab3-84ce-332e-8747-86fbdb818769",
                                        "entry_id": "8a85884c-c5b9-36ae-b9a5-d5ac55e4aae0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Trace d’eau."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ee11d72d-0c29-4940-a6b5-1f5141c89c93",
                                                "sense_id": "55864ab3-84ce-332e-8747-86fbdb818769",
                                                "text": "Je m’arrêtai un instant sur un banc ruisselant de pluie, et tel était mon accablement que je ne sentais point l’humidité froide."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "77986e7b-829f-46da-a7be-097eee7bd951",
                                                "sense_id": "55864ab3-84ce-332e-8747-86fbdb818769",
                                                "text": "Les murs ruisselaient d’humidité, secrétaient des roupies, distillaient des gouttes de café noir […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1ad522c9-94ec-4206-a925-21fcefbcf834",
                                                "sense_id": "55864ab3-84ce-332e-8747-86fbdb818769",
                                                "text": "Lo… installait maintenant sur le sol une planche noire, suintante d’humidité, souillée et gluante des vomissures laissées sans doute par d’autres « clients »."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8dde1d6e-83ce-379d-a8f5-aefb69054ac5",
                                        "entry_id": "8a85884c-c5b9-36ae-b9a5-d5ac55e4aae0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Lieu humide."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Plus rare"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fe5a6542-6ef2-4c36-aae0-a5da1bee7e7f",
                                                "sense_id": "8dde1d6e-83ce-379d-a8f5-aefb69054ac5",
                                                "text": "Le désert solognot se confirme et semble se complaire dans son isolement comme au temps où marécages et autres humidités l’écartaient du reste du monde."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "292d9e45-e12f-4f68-bf50-4450a89dd918",
                        "source_entry_id": "fb704ba9-bfc8-36f2-a4af-bb06dca5f449",
